<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1444037351"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:53.480"><div begin="59.842" end="1:30.742" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="59.842" end="1:02.237" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.842" end="1:00.301">有</span><span begin="1:00.301" end="1:00.518">始</span><span begin="1:00.518" end="1:01.285">不</span><span begin="1:01.285" end="1:01.586">有</span><span begin="1:01.586" end="1:02.237">终</span></p><p begin="1:03.729" end="1:06.474" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.729" end="1:04.137">能</span><span begin="1:04.137" end="1:04.497">受</span><span begin="1:04.497" end="1:05.209">百</span><span begin="1:05.209" end="1:05.516">样</span><span begin="1:05.516" end="1:06.474">痛</span></p><p begin="1:07.631" end="1:11.243" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.631" end="1:08.293">从</span><span begin="1:08.293" end="1:08.525">没</span><span begin="1:08.525" end="1:09.291">有</span><span begin="1:09.291" end="1:09.460">合</span><span begin="1:09.460" end="1:09.994">约</span><span begin="1:09.994" end="1:10.377">合</span><span begin="1:10.377" end="1:11.243">同</span></p><p begin="1:11.618" end="1:14.768" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.618" end="1:12.230">但</span><span begin="1:12.230" end="1:12.515">却</span><span begin="1:12.515" end="1:13.214">跨</span><span begin="1:13.214" end="1:13.667">时</span><span begin="1:13.667" end="1:14.768">空</span></p><p begin="1:15.594" end="1:19.570" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.594" end="1:16.118">这</span><span begin="1:16.118" end="1:16.444">滔</span><span begin="1:16.444" end="1:17.678">滔</span><span begin="1:17.678" end="1:18.145">不</span><span begin="1:18.145" end="1:18.514">息</span><span begin="1:18.514" end="1:18.981">的</span><span begin="1:18.981" end="1:19.570">爱</span></p><p begin="1:19.709" end="1:22.524" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.709" end="1:20.157">我</span><span begin="1:20.157" end="1:20.471">赠</span><span begin="1